<title>USA: TABLE-Capsure Holdings Inc Q2 net lower.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Capsure Holdings Inc Q2 net lower.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr primary		$0.22		    $0.31</p>
<p> Shr diluted		 0.22		     0.31</p>
<p> Net			  3,737		    5,005</p>
<p> Revs			26,309		   28,828</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	16,600		   15,955</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted	16,613		   15,968</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q2 1997 earnings per share from continuing operating segments were $0.20 vs $0.26. Oper earnings exclude the effects of investment gains and losses, and a non-recurring Q2 1996 charge related to debt refinancing, as well as non-continuing segments.  </p>
<p>SIX MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr primary		$0.45		    $0.66</p>
<p> Shr diluted		 0.45		     0.66</p>
<p> Net			  7,550		   10,525</p>
<p> Revs			51,818		   57,734</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	16,594		   15,931</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted	16,613		   15,968</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: First half 1997 earnings per share from continuing operating segments were $0.43 vs $0.43. Oper earnings exclude the effects of investment gains and losses, and a non-recurring Q2 1996 charge related to debt refinancing, as well as non-continuing segments.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
